  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.57 “Instructor training program” means a division approved educational program to assist a person to teach or coordinate EMS training programs.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, effe 5-24-19",
